#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 31
#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file ./kcfg/smimevalidationpreferences.kcfg line 7
#: rc.cpp:130 rc.cpp:136 rc.cpp:329
msgid ""
"This option enables interval checking of certificate validity. You can also "
"choose the checking interval (in hours). Note that validation is perfomed "
"implicitly whenever significant files in ~/.gnupg change. This option "
"therefore only affects external factors of certificate validity."
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, warrt tietstüert pröövt, wat dat Zertifikaat gellt. Du kannst ok de Töövtiet in Stunnen fastleggen. Beacht, jümmers wenn sik de tohören Dateien binnen \"~/.gnupg\" ännert, warrt dat Gellen pröövt. Disse Optschoon pröövt also bloots extern Ännern."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 21
#: rc.cpp:133
#| msgid "Certificate Deletion Failed"
msgid "Check certificate validity every"
msgstr "Zertifikaatgellen jümmers na"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 37
#: rc.cpp:139
msgid "hour"
msgstr "Stünn pröven"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 40
#: rc.cpp:142
msgid " hours"
msgstr "Stünnen pröven"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 68
#: rc.cpp:145
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, S/MIME certificates are validated using "
"Certificate Revocation Lists (CRLs)."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt S/MIME-Zertifikaten över Zertifikaat-Torüchrooplisten (ZTLs) pröövt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 71
#: rc.cpp:148
msgid "Validate certificates using CRLs"
msgstr "Zertifikaatgellen mit ZTLs pröven"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 81
#: rc.cpp:151
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, S/MIME certificates are validated online using "
"the Online Certificates Status Protocol (OCSP). Fill in the URL of the OCSP "
"responder below."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt S/MIME-Zertifikaten direktemang över't Internet mit "
"dat Internet-Zertifikaattostandprotokoll (\"Online Certificates Status "
"Protocol\", OCSP) pröövt. Giff bitte de URL vun den OCSP-Server nerrn in."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 84
#: rc.cpp:154
msgid "Validate certificates online (OCSP)"
msgstr "Zertifikaten över Internet pröven (OCSP)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 94
#: rc.cpp:157
#| msgid "Fetching Certificate Chain"
msgid "Online Certificate Validation"
msgstr "Internet-Zertifikaatprööv"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 100
#: rc.cpp:160
msgid "OCSP responder URL:"
msgstr "URL vun den OCSP-Server:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 110
#: rc.cpp:163
msgid ""
"Enter here the address of the server for online validation of certificates "
"(OCSP responder). The URL is usually starting with http://."
msgstr ""
"Giff hier de Adress vun den Server för't Pröven vun Zertifikaattostänn över "
"Internet in (OCSP-Server). De URL fangt normalerwies mit http:// an."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 117
#: rc.cpp:166
#| msgid "New signatures:"
msgid "OCSP responder signature:"
msgstr "Ünnerschrift vun den OCSP-Server:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 127
#: rc.cpp:169
msgid ""
"Enter here the certificate used to sign responses of the server for online "
"validation of certificates (OCSP responder). The certificate is identified "
"by its <em>fingerprint</em>."
msgstr "Giff hier bitte dat Zertifikaat in, mit dat de OCSP-Server sien Antwoorden ünnerschrifft. Dat Zertifikaat warrt över sien <em>Fingerafdruck</em> kennt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 134
#: rc.cpp:172
#| msgid "In Local Certificates"
msgid "Ignore service URL of certificates"
msgstr "Deens-URLs binnen Zertifikaten övergahn"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 144
#: rc.cpp:175
msgid ""
"By default GnuPG uses the file ~/.gnupg/policies.txt to check if a "
"certificate policy is allowed. If this option is selected, policies are not "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Standardwies kiekt GnuPG binnen de Datei \"~./gnupg/policies.txt\", wat en "
"Zertifikaatregel verlöövt is. Is dit anmaakt, warrt de Regeln nich pröövt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 147
#: rc.cpp:178
msgid "Do not check certificate policies"
msgstr "Zertifikaatregeln nich pröven"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 154
#: rc.cpp:181
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, Certificate Revocation Lists are never used to "
"validate S/MIME certificates."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt Zertifikaat-Torüchrooplisten nienich för't Pröven vun S/MIME-Zertifikaten bruukt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 157
#: rc.cpp:184
msgid "Never consult a CRL"
msgstr "ZTLs nienich bruken"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 164
#: rc.cpp:187
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, missing issuer certificates are fetched when "
"necessary (this applies to both validation methods, CRLs and OCSP)"
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt fehlen Rutgeverzertifikaten daallaadt, wenn nödig "
"(gellt för beed Pröövmetoden, ZTLs un OCSP)"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 167
#: rc.cpp:190
#| msgid "Fetching Certificate Chain"
msgid "Fetch missing issuer certificates"
msgstr "Fehlen Rutgeverzertifikaten daalladen"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 183
#: rc.cpp:193
msgid "&HTTP Requests"
msgstr "&HTTP-Anfragen"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 189
#: rc.cpp:196
msgid "Entirely disables the use of HTTP for S/MIME."
msgstr "Maakt HTTP för S/MIME heel ut"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 192
#: rc.cpp:199
msgid "Do not perform any HTTP requests"
msgstr "Keen HTTP-Anfragen utföhren"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 199
#: rc.cpp:202
msgid ""
"When looking for the location of a CRL, the to-be-tested certificate usually "
"contains what are known as \"CRL Distribution Point\" (DP) entries, which "
"are URLs describing the way to access the URL. The first found DP entry is "
"used.  With this option all entries using the HTTP scheme are ignored when "
"looking for a suitable DP."
msgstr "Zertifikaten bargt normalerwies Indrääg över so nöömt ZTL-Verdeelsteden (\"CRL Distribution Points\") - dat sünd URLs, ünner de künnig maakt warrt, woneem sik de ZTL findt. De eerste Verdeelsteed-Indrag warrt bruukt. Is disse Optschoon anmaakt, warrt all Indrääg övergahn, de dat HTTP-Protokoll bruukt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 202
#: rc.cpp:205
msgid "Ignore HTTP CRL distribution point of certificates"
msgstr "HTTP-ZTL-Verdeelsteden ut Zertifikaten övergahn"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 209
#: rc.cpp:208
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, the value of the HTTP proxy shown on the right "
"(which comes from the environment variable http_proxy) will be used for any "
"HTTP request."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt de Weert för den HTTP-Proxy (rechterhand wiest, Weert "
"vun de Ümgeven-Variabel \"http_proxy\") för all HTTP-Anfragen bruukt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 212
#: rc.cpp:211
msgid "Use system HTTP proxy:"
msgstr "Systeem-HTTP-Proxyserver bruken:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 229
#: rc.cpp:217
msgid "Use this proxy for HTTP requests: "
msgstr "Dissen Proxy för HTTP-Anfragen bruken: "

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 236
#: rc.cpp:220
msgid ""
"Enter here the location of your HTTP Proxy, which will be used for all HTTP "
"requests relating to S/MIME. The syntax is host:port, for instance myproxy."
"nowhere.com:3128."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du de Adress vun Dien HTTP-Proxy ingeven, de för all HTTP-Anfragen för S/MIME bruukt warrt. De Schriefwies is \"Reekner:Port\", a.B. \"mienproxy.narms.nds:3128\"."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 265
#: rc.cpp:223
msgid "&LDAP Requests"
msgstr "&LDAP-Anfragen"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 271
#: rc.cpp:226
msgid "Entirely disables the use of LDAP for S/MIME."
msgstr "Maakt den Bruuk vun LDAP för S/MIME heel ut."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 274
#: rc.cpp:229
msgid "Do not perform any LDAP requests"
msgstr "Keen LDAP-Anfragen utföhren"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 281
#: rc.cpp:232
msgid ""
"When looking for the location of a CRL, the to-be-tested certificate usually "
"contains what are known as \"CRL Distribution Point\" (DP) entries, which "
"are URLs describing the way to access the URL. The first found DP entry is "
"used.  With this option all entries using the LDAP scheme are ignored when "
"looking for a suitable DP."
msgstr "Zertifikaten bargt normalerwies Indrääg över so nöömt ZTL-Verdeelsteden (\"CRL Distribution Points\") - dat sünd URLs, ünner de künnig maakt warrt, woneem sik de ZTL findt. De eerste Verdeelsteed-Indrag warrt bruukt. Is disse Optschoon anmaakt, warrt all Indrääg övergahn, de LDAP bruukt."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 284
#: rc.cpp:235
msgid "Ignore LDAP CRL distribution point of certificates"
msgstr "LDAP-ZTL-Verdeelsteden ut Zertifikaten övergahn"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 291
#: rc.cpp:238
msgid "Primary host for LDAP requests:"
msgstr "Hööftreekner för LDAP-Anfragen:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./conf/smimevalidationconfigurationwidget.ui line 302
#: rc.cpp:241
msgid ""
"Entering a LDAP server here will make all LDAP requests go to that server "
"first. More precisely, this setting overrides any specified host and port "
"part in a LDAP URL and will also be used if host and port have been omitted "
"from the URL. Other LDAP servers will be used only if the connection to the "
"\"proxy\" failed.\n"
"The syntax is \"HOST\" or \"HOST:PORT\". If PORT is omitted, port 389 "
"(standard LDAP port) is used."
msgstr ""
"Giffst Du hier en LDAP-Server an, gaht all LDAP-Anfragen toeerst na dissen Server. Wat denn redig passeert is, disse Reekner warrt ansteed all angeven oder ok nich angeven Reekner- un Portdelen vun en LDAP-URLs bruukt. Anner LDAP-Servers warrt bloots bruukt, wenn dat Tokoppeln na den \"Proxy\" fehlsleit.\n"
"De Schriefwies is \"Reekner\" oder \"Reekner:Port\". Is keen Port angeven, warrt Port 389 (Standardport för LDAP) bruukt."

